Create an animation that:
Scene 1 – Wide-angle

The camera from above shows the endless expanse of the desert.

The golden sands shine under the soft silver light of the moon.

There is absolute silence and the sound of a gentle wind.

Scene 2 – Slope Down

The camera slowly descends from the starry sky.

The stars shine like diamonds.

Scene 3 – Close-up of the sky

Suddenly, a bright light appears in the sky.

A large meteorite is falling with a fiery trail.

A sharp, heavy roar splits the air.

Scene 4 – Meteorite Tracking

The camera moves with the meteorite towards the ground.

The angle of view conveys a sense of speed and excitement.

Scene 5 – Impact Shot

The meteorite hits the dunes.

Blasts of sand and intense light fill the scene.

Sand spreads like waves in the air.

Shot 6 – Slow Aftermath

Sand particles hang in the air.

The sound of a bomb-like impact slowly fades.

The camera slowly zooms in on the crater that has been created.
